ADLK <expr> D002 2 2 tms-long
ADRK <expr> 7E00 2 0 tms-fold valid-mask=FF
AND <reg>,<expr> 4E88 2 0 tms-fold valid-mask=7
AND <reg> 4E80 2 0 plain
AND <expr> 4E00 2 0 tms-fold valid-mask=7F
ANDK <expr>,<expr> D004 2 2 tms-long valid-mask=F00 shift=8
ANDK <expr> D004 2 2 tms-long
